    {
      "id": "claim_fb03b5eb5fe34875909fe36b94f56366",
      "statement": "`FakePorts` is a mock provider (not a real sandbox integration) that exposes tunable fields—`paymentFailure`, `shippingFailure`, `refundFailure`, `released`, `refunded`, and `shippingStatus`—to simulate specific failure conditions and record side effects during saga execution.",
